  Slug: ruin-delver
  DisplayName: Ruin Delver
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You've looked through some of the smaller ruins in the Otari hinterlands
    but have never quite built up the courage to check out the creepy lighthouse
    called Gauntlight. You've heard that these ruins are pretty well picked over,
    and mostly collapsed, but you always planned to some day explore them and perhaps
    find some bauble left behind from the centuries-old battle where the Roseguard
    slew an evil sorcerer. You know that the crumbled stone of old ruins has a tendency
    to shift, so you'd better step lightly if you get the chance to explore Gauntlight.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Intelligence , and one
    is a free attribute boost. You're trained in Acrobatics and the Roseguard Lore
    skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Cat Fall] skill feat.
